      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "**Application activity** — high-level usage and engagement signals from Prometheus (OpenTelemetry → collector).\n\n**Distinct characters** uses Redis HyperLogLog (approximate; fixed rolling UTC windows, not Grafana’s time picker). Each API replica exports the same gauge (shared Redis); panels use **`max()`** so multi-replica deploys are not **summed** (which would inflate the number).\n\n**Market prices / system indexes averages** are computed over the selected Grafana timeframe with `increase(...[$__range])`, so they are whole-range averages (not rolling 5m).\n\n**New users** come from API first-login creations (`api.eve_token_login.new_users_total`). **Total users** is counted from Mongo in core (`core.users.total`) so it includes historic data.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Approximate distinct OAuth owner hashes with ≥1 successful EVE OAuth token refresh in the rolling prior **24 UTC hours** (Redis HyperLogLog merge). Not tied to Grafana’s time picker window.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(api_eve_sso_token_refresh_distinct_characters_last_24h)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Distinct characters (rolling 24h UTC)",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Distinct characters · 24h window",
      "type": "stat"
    },
